# class: stair-safety
# origin: issue #364 (the plan `arch finish --only furnish` wrote, with the sofa and coffee table it put on the flight)
# expect: W_FURNITURE_ON_STAIR
# status: done
# fact: stair s1 rises from y 5500; with a 3000 mm storey its first 2000 mm of run, y 3500-5500, leaves under 2 m of
#   headroom. The sofa covers x 2950-3500, y 3500-5000 of that and the coffee table x 2500-2550, y 3500-4500
plan "Stair in the living room" {
  units mm
  room id=hall at (0,0) size 4000x2000 label "Hall" uses hall
  room id=liv at (0,2000) size 4000x4000 label "Living" uses living
  walls from rooms exterior 300 partition 100
  door on hall.top at center width 1000 swing into hall
  door between hall and liv at 2000 from start width 900 swing into liv
  window on liv.bottom width 2000
  stair id=s1 at (2500,2500) size 1000x3000 dir up
  furniture sofa in liv anchor right flush size 900x2000 rotate 90
  furniture coffee_table in liv anchor right flush inset 1300 size 600x1000 rotate 90
}
